LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_EventScript_ScottAboardSSTidalCall::
	lockall
	pokenavcall LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ScottAboardSSTidalCall
	waitmessage
	clearflag FLAG_SCOTT_CALL_BATTLE_FRONTIER
	releaseall
	end

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchAwayOnFieldwork:
	.string "咦？小田卷博士？\p"
	.string "博士出去做野外调查了。\n"
	.string "所以，他不在。\p"
	.string "哦，让我解释一下\n"
	.string "什么是野外调查。\p"
	.string "就是在田野、山里这样\n"
	.string "的自然环境中研究，\l"
	.string "而不是在实验室里。\p"
	.string "博士不适合坐办公桌。\n"
	.string "他是那种宁愿出去\l"
	.string "亲身体验，也不想\l"
	.string "在这里看书的人。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchIsntOneForDeskWork:
	.string "博士不适合坐办公桌。\n"
	.string "他是那种宁愿出去\l"
	.string "亲身体验，也不想\l"
	.string "在这里看书的人。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchEnjoysRivalsHelpToo:
	.string "小田卷博士正在研究\n"
	.string "宝可梦的栖息与分布。\p"
	.string "博士也很喜欢有{RIVAL}\n"
	.string "来帮忙。他们感情很好。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_LikeYouToHavePokemon:
	.string "欢迎来到小田卷博士\n"
	.string "的研究所！\p"
	.string "和小田卷博士说话，\n"
	.string "就能更换可选的\l"
	.string "初始宝可梦的地区。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_WhyNotGiveNicknameToMon:
	.string "既然这样，何不给\n"
	.string "那只{STR_VAR_1}起个昵称？$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MightBeGoodIdeaToGoSeeRival:
	.string "如果在宝可梦上多下功夫\n"
	.string "积累经验，我想你会成为\l"
	.string "非常出色的训练家。\p"
	.string "我家的{RIVAL}也在帮我\n"
	.string "研究宝可梦。\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}，你不觉得去\n"
	.string "见见{RIVAL}是个好主意吗？$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_GetRivalToTeachYou:
	.string "太好了！\n"
	.string "{RIVAL}也会高兴的。\p"
	.string "让{RIVAL}教教你\n"
	.string "当训练家意味着什么吧。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_DontBeThatWay:
	.string "哦，别这样嘛。\n"
	.string "你该去见见我家的孩子。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRivalGoneHome:
	.string "{RIVAL}？\n"
	.string "我想是回家了。\p"
	.string "也许那孩子又跑到\n"
	.string "哪里钻高草去了……\p"
	.string "要是你或宝可梦累了，\n"
	.string "就回家休息一下。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_HeardYouBeatRivalTakePokedex:
	.string "哦，你好，{PLAYER}！\p"
	.string "我听说你第一次就\n"
	.string "打赢了{RIVAL}。太棒了！\p"
	.string "{RIVAL}帮我做研究\n"
	.string "已经很久了。\p"
	.string "{RIVAL}当训练家的\n"
	.string "经历也相当丰富。\p"
	.string "来，{PLAYER}，这个本来是\n"
	.string "我研究用的，不过\l"
	.string "我想该把它交给你。\l"
	.string "这是宝可梦图鉴。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ReceivedPokedex:
	.string "{PLAYER}得到了宝可梦图鉴！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ExplainPokedex:
	.string "宝可梦图鉴是一种高科技\n"
	.string "工具，会自动记录\l"
	.string "你遇到或抓到的宝可梦。\p"
	.string "我家的{RIVAL}总是\n"
	.string "带着它到处跑。\p"
	.string "每当那孩子抓到稀有宝可梦\n"
	.string "并把资料记进图鉴，\l"
	.string "就会趁我野外调查时\l"
	.string "找到我，给我看。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CountlessPokemonAwait:
	.string "无数的宝可梦\n"
	.string "在等着你！\p"
	.string "唉，我又想去外面\n"
	.string "做野外调查了！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayGotPokedexTooTakeThese:
	.string "哦，还有，{PLAYER}，\n"
	.string "这些我已经给过{RIVAL}了。\p"
	.string "我敢说这些初始道具\n"
	.string "越来越高级了。\l"
	.string "我那时候，还得拿着\l"
	.string "道具上坡下坡走\l"
	.string "两趟去商店，还没有……\p"
	.string "扯远了，你就拿着吧。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CatchCutePokemonWithPokeBalls:
	.string "那一套道具包括所有\n"
	.string "基础属性增强道具，\l"
	.string "还有一些橙橙果、精灵球\l"
	.string "和别的杂七杂八的东西。\p"
	.string "翻翻你的背包口袋，\n"
	.string "就能全看到了。\p"
	.string "那么，祝你的宝可梦之旅\n"
	.string "顺利，{PLAYER}，\l"
	.string "我会为你加油的！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_OhYourBagsFull:
	.string "哦？你的背包满了。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayWhereShouldIGoNext:
	.string "小遥：我接下来该去\n"
	.string "哪里找宝可梦呢？$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanGotPokedexTooTakeThese:
	.string "佑树：哦……\n"
	.string "你也拿到图鉴了。\p"
	.string "那好吧，来。\n"
	.string "这些给你。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CatchCoolPokemonWithPokeBalls:
	.string "佑树：你知道吗，拥有\n"
	.string "一大堆宝可梦更有趣。\p"
	.string "我要到处去探索，\n"
	.string "寻找不同的宝可梦。\p"
	.string "要是找到酷的宝可梦，\n"
	.string "我一定用精灵球抓回来。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_HeyYourBagsFull:
	.string "喂，你的背包满了。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanWhereShouldIGoNext:
	.string "佑树：接下来该去哪里\n"
	.string "找宝可梦呢……$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_SeriousLookingMachine:
	.string "看起来是很正经的机器。\n"
	.string "博士一定是用它做研究。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_PCUsedForResearch:
	.string "这是研究用的电脑。\n"
	.string "还是别乱动为好。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CrammedWithBooksOnPokemon:
	.string "这里塞满了关于\n"
	.string "宝可梦的书。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BookTooHardToRead:
	.string "这本书太难读了。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_OtherRegionsUpgradeToNational:
	.string "现在……\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}和{RIVAL}，你们俩\n"
	.string "都帮我研究了宝可梦。\p"
	.string "多亏你们，新的\n"
	.string "事实逐渐浮现。\p"
	.string "看来丰缘地区也有\n"
	.string "来自其他地区的\l"
	.string "宝可梦。\p"
	.string "这说明丰缘的自然环境\n"
	.string "是多么丰富多样。\p"
	.string "所以我觉得有必要把\n"
	.string "你们的图鉴升级成\l"
	.string "全国模式。\p"
	.string "来，把你们的图鉴\n"
	.string "给我看看。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayUpgradeSoCool:
	.string "小遥：嘿嘿！\p"
	.string "连我的图鉴也要更新，\n"
	.string "太酷了！\p"
	.string "这都是因为你出去\n"
	.string "抓了那么多宝可梦，{PLAYER}！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanYouCanThankMe:
	.string "佑树：我跑遍了整个丰缘，\n"
	.string "调查了各种宝可梦。\p"
	.string "你能拿到全国模式图鉴，\n"
	.string "可真该谢谢我。\p"
	.string "没错，你很走运，{PLAYER}！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_OkayAllDone:
	.string "好，全都弄好了！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_PokedexUpgradedToNational:
	.string "{PLAYER}的图鉴升级成了\n"
	.string "全国模式！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_GrassyPatchWaiting2:
	.string "不过你听我说。\n"
	.string "你虽然成了冠军，\l"
	.string "但你的宝可梦之旅还没结束。\p"
	.string "宝可梦这条路\n"
	.string "是没有尽头的。\p"
	.string "在某个地方，总有一片\n"
	.string "草地等着你！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayTakeBreakFromFieldwork:
	.string "小遥：我想暂时放下\n"
	.string "野外调查，休息一下。\p"
	.string "我打算在这里帮帮\n"
	.string "博士。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanTakeBreakFromFieldwork:
	.string "佑树：眼下我打算\n"
	.string "暂停野外调查。\p"
	.string "我会在这里帮博士\n"
	.string "一阵子。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CompletedDexChoosePokemon:
	.string "哦，{PLAYER}！\n"
	.string "让我看看你的图鉴。\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "对，毫无疑问。\p"
	.string "你真的完成了丰缘地区\n"
	.string "的宝可梦图鉴。\p"
	.string "这已经不只是\n"
	.string "了不起的程度了。\p"
	.string "我有个礼物给你。\p"
	.string "就当是我对你出色工作\n"
	.string "表示的感谢。\p"
	.string "我的礼物是只有在别的\n"
	.string "地区才能找到的稀有宝可梦！\p"
	.string "这三只里，你可以\n"
	.string "任选一只！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_CanHaveAnyOneOfRarePokemon:
	.string "这些是只有在别的地区\n"
	.string "才能找到的稀有宝可梦！\p"
	.string "这三只里，你可以\n"
	.string "任选一只！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_YoullTakeCyndaquil:
	.string "火属性的火球鼠\n"
	.string "吸引了你的目光！\p"
	.string "你的眼光还是一样准！\p"
	.string "那么，你选火球鼠？$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_YoullTakeTotodile:
	.string "水属性的小锯鳄\n"
	.string "是你的选择！\p"
	.string "你真会挑。\p"
	.string "那么，你要小锯鳄？$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_YoullTakeChikorita:
	.string "草属性的菊草叶\n"
	.string "是你的选择！\p"
	.string "你还真懂行。\p"
	.string "那么，你要菊草叶？$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_TakeYourTimeAllInvaluable:
	.string "慢慢决定，\n"
	.string "不用着急。\p"
	.string "它们都是无比珍贵的\n"
	.string "宝可梦。$"

@ Unused
LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_PickedFinePokemon:
	.string "我明白了！\n"
	.string "你挑了只好宝可梦！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_ReceivedJohtoStarter:
	.string "{PLAYER}从小田卷博士那里\n"
	.string "得到了{STR_VAR_1}！$"

@ Unused
LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_NicknameJohtoStarter:
	.string "要给得到的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
	.string "起个昵称吗？$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_GrassyPatchWaiting:
	.string "听我说，{PLAYER}。\n"
	.string "你完成了丰缘图鉴，\l"
	.string "但你的宝可梦之旅还没结束。\p"
	.string "宝可梦这条路\n"
	.string "是没有尽头的。\p"
	.string "在某个地方，总有一片\n"
	.string "草地等着你！$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BetterLeaveOthersAlone:
	.string "你收到了说好的宝可梦。\n"
	.string "其他的就别管了。$"

@ Unused
LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_DontHaveAnyRoomForPokemon:
	.string "哦，你没有地方\n"
	.string "放这只宝可梦了。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayWhatNextImStayingHere:
	.string "小遥：{PLAYER}，接下来……\n"
	.string "你打算做什么？\p"
	.string "继续对战，磨练\n"
	.string "自己的实力？\p"
	.string "还是试着填满\n"
	.string "全国图鉴？\p"
	.string "我打算留在这里\n"
	.string "帮博士。$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanPreferCollectingSlowly:
	.string "佑树：与其到处收集\n"
	.string "宝可梦，我更喜欢\l"
	.string "慢慢培养自己选的那只。$"

